at the east entrance.

257
00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:54.440
-Go. go. go!
-Move it!

258
00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:58.440
David. report position. Do you have cover?

259
00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:00.160
-We're in.
-Wait.

260
00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:02.840
Secure your position.
I'm sending back up to you now.

261
00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.760
Go. go!

262
00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:09.480
Reposition. north-west entrance.
Repeat. north-west.

263
00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:11.360
We just heard isolated gunshots

264
00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.880
