265
00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.400
This could indicate that GIGN
is entering the building.

266
00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.880
-GSW! Clear the way!
-I've got a crash cart!

267
00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.480
Support his pelvis. His pelvis.
They're loading them now.

268
00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:31.280
-One. two. three.
-Get him on the gurney.

269
00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.440
-Okay. strap her in.
-Need oxygen!

270
00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.160
You're taking the second victim.

271
00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:39.200
-Move out of the way.
-You're gonna be fine.

272
00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:41.440
If you need backup.
let me know right away.

273
00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.960
You good?

274
00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:45.720
-Fine. that's it.
-We need you. Okay? You'll be fine.

275
00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:47.360
Keep your eyes open. you'll be okay.

276
00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:50.200
-Let me know.
-She was shot on the right side.

277
00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:52.640
-You'll be fine. Rapha.
-Come on!

278
00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:55.160
