294
00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:01.440
Chloé. look at this camera feed.

295
00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:03.200
We've got two more at the top.

296
00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:09.160
Cédric. there's a total
of five Tangos in the auditorium.

297
00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:14.000
There it is! I've got the van on a camera.

298
00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:18.080
-It was at a self-storage yesterday.
-Okay. we're on it.

299
00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.200
Rico. come here. take over for me.

300
00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.320
Shut the fuck up!

301
00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:46.800
Cédric.

302
00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:51.040
Terrorist's on the line.
She wants to talk to David.

303
00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.720
-David?
-Yeah. go ahead.

304
00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.840
Terrorist on the line.
It's a woman.

305
00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.520
Chloé and I are listening in.

306
00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.320
She wants to talk to you.

307
00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:05.920
Okay. put her on.

308
00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.640
Connecting.

309
00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:34.640
Surely you must know this is personal.

310
00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.640
The GIGN took everything from me.

311
00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:42.080
France took everything from me.

312
00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:45.920
But you took my whole family.

313
00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.480
My girl. my husband. my blood.

314
00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.560
-I'll find your girl. I have a daughter.
-Save her.

315
00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:55.560
Amal Mayard?

316
00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.400
-Commander Berger.
-Oh. shit.

317
00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:06.280
Like I said.
it's personal between you and me.

318
00:22:06.960 --> 00:22:08.560
LAST FLOOR - FREIGHT ELEVATOR

319
00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.480
I'm not here to negotiate. David.

320
00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.880
I'm here today
to take everything from you.

321
00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:19.760
And the whole world will be watching.

322
00:22:25.400 --> 00:22:26.560
Oh. fuck.

323
00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:28.880
In the army she specialized

324
00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:30.760
in long-range shooting.

325
00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:33.320
I'll take care of Amal.

326
00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:35.960
Let's go. guys.

327
00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.840
Tango leader
is on a suicide mission.

328
00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:40.120
She's gonna execute the hostages.
We have to move in now.

329
00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:48.800
-It's nothing.
-Lemme see your arm.

330
00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:50.920
-Nothing to see.
-I have to check. It's my job.

331
00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:53.440
See? It's nothing. It's just bullshit.

332
00:22:53.520 --> 00:22:55.280
-Is he fit?
-Damn right I'm fit.

333
00:22:55.360 --> 00:22:57.240
-Great. everyone in the Sherpa.
-Nice.

334
00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:22.720
Guys! Guys! Listen up for a minute.

335
00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.920
We're going into a building full of CL-20.

336
00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:29.960
No matter what. we can't let them
detonate those explosives.

337
00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:33.200
As you know. our motto is.
"A commitment to life. to all lives."

338
00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:36.080
Unfortunately. there are situations
that call for hard choices.

339
00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:40.480
So. Valère. Djibril. PJ. Nico. Max.
I'm going to need your sniper skills.

340
00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:42.960
If we want to save the hostages.
we have to do some shooting.

341
00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:45.960
It's the only way.
But you're only gonna get one shot.

342
00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:47.720
So you better make sure it counts.

343
00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:50.080
This is an operation
of the utmost delicacy.

344
00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:52.920
Let's do a good job
so we all go home tonight. please.

345
00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:55.920
Alright. let's go! In the truck!

346
00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.520
-Gonna be okay. Valère?
-Totally.

347
00:23:57.600 --> 00:23:58.840
-You got this. Demo?
-Hell yeah.

348
00:23:58.880 --> 00:24:01.920
-Deal with the CL-20.
-All set to move. I'm sticking with Recon.

349
00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.880
Okay. guys. let's go.

350
00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:23.760
Yeah?

351
00:24:23.840 --> 00:24:27.440
Chloé. on the cams for the music school.
can you see the targets go in?

352
00:24:29.400 --> 00:24:30.440
Affirmative.

353
00:24:30.520 --> 00:24:32.560
And can you see them coming out?

354
00:24:35.640 --> 00:24:37.040
Uh. negative.

355
00:24:37.120 --> 00:24:38.360
Ah. fuck.

356
00:24:38.960 --> 00:24:41.320
Somehow. they still fired at us
from the building next door.

357
00:24:41.400 --> 00:24:42.840
so there has to be. uh…

358
00:24:42.920 --> 00:24:44.400
An accomplice. maybe?

359
00:24:44.480 --> 00:24:45.920
An underground passage.

360
00:24:47.400 --> 00:24:49.040
Cédric. I'm dividing the team.

361
00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:52.000
Okay. guys. let's switch up the plan.

362
00:24:52.080 --> 00:24:54.040
We're looking for a tunnel. Schwepps.

363
00:24:54.120 --> 00:24:56.360
You two go down that hallway.
We'll meet at the end.

364
00:24:56.440 --> 00:24:59.240
Sergio. you guys take the third floor.

365
00:24:59.320 --> 00:25:00.520
We'll meet at the end.

366
00:25:00.600 --> 00:25:03.600
Okay. I'm 15 minutes out.
I'll call you from the warehouse.

367
00:25:03.680 --> 00:25:05.720
Copy that. Sending in the Sherpa.

368
00:25:09.880 --> 00:25:11.080
Cédric?

369
00:25:11.160 --> 00:25:12.600
Any news about Rapha?

370
00:25:12.680 --> 00:25:15.760
She's in good hands.
Keep your head in the game. Max.

371
00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:16.720
You know how it works.

372
00:25:16.800 --> 00:25:19.080
If a teammate goes down.
step over them and keep moving.

373
00:25:19.160 --> 00:25:21.120
If you can't handle it.
get off the truck now.

374
00:27:05.640 --> 00:27:07.360
We just entered building B.

375
00:27:08.680 --> 00:27:10.560
There's a man down in hallway S.

376
00:27:12.760 --> 00:27:16.160
Team 1 proceeding
through hallway V. Nothing to report.

377
00:27:17.640 --> 00:27:20.200
Team 2 NSTR in hallway D.

378
00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:27.360
We're crossing over
to building A.

379
00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:33.800
Delta Echo Alpha Delta.

380
00:27:39.960 --> 00:27:41.640
Separate columns.

381
00:28:03.240 --> 00:28:04.320
Stop there!

382
00:28:06.960 --> 00:28:08.560
Turn around nice and slow.

383
00:28:10.440 --> 00:28:11.960
Put your weapon on the ground.

384
00:28:15.120 --> 00:28:16.480
Hands on your head.

385
00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.000
No!

386
00:28:31.760 --> 00:28:32.920
That's not the plan.

387
00:28:39.600 --> 00:28:40.960
I want him to live.

388
00:28:44.840 --> 00:28:46.320
He's gonna see the whole thing.

389
00:28:47.760 --> 00:28:50.240
He's gonna find out how it feels.

390
00:29:05.920 --> 00:29:07.040
It's over.

391
00:29:07.920 --> 00:29:09.520
You're surrounded.

392
00:29:09.600 --> 00:29:12.720
Pretty soon.
you'll all be in cuffs or body bags.

393
00:29:15.160 --> 00:29:16.320
It's over.

394
00:29:20.880 --> 00:29:24.480
It isn't over until I say so.

395
00:29:37.800 --> 00:29:39.320
We're on the roof.

396
00:29:44.240 --> 00:29:46.120
Still five terrorists
in the auditorium.

397
00:29:46.200 --> 00:29:48.960
Three with the hostages.
Two at the top of the stairs.

398
00:29:57.320 --> 00:29:59.000
Snipers in position.

399
00:30:06.440 --> 00:30:07.480
Okay.

400
00:30:08.400 --> 00:30:10.960
Section 1.
we are go to enter the auditorium.

401
00:30:27.680 --> 00:30:29.640
Shh.

402
00:30:33.320 --> 00:30:35.000
David. do you copy?

403
00:30:36.120 --> 00:30:38.040
We found him.

404
00:30:39.160 --> 00:30:40.680
David!

405
00:30:41.200 --> 00:30:42.760
David!

406
00:30:42.840 --> 00:30:43.840
You okay?

407
00:30:44.640 --> 00:30:45.520
I'm okay.

408
00:30:45.600 --> 00:30:47.160
-Can you get up?
-Yeah.

409
00:30:48.160 --> 00:30:50.840
-We're returning to hallway N.
-Thanks.

410
00:30:53.440 --> 00:30:56.360
For the sniper shot.
it's countdown. then three seconds.

411
00:30:56.440 --> 00:30:58.600
Snipers. when you're ready.
start the sequence.

412
00:31:11.920 --> 00:31:12.920
One. ready.

413
00:31:13.440 --> 00:31:14.520
Two. ready.

414
00:31:14.600 --> 00:31:15.680
Three. ready.

415
00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:16.880
Four. ready.

416
00:31:16.960 --> 00:31:18.200
Five. no target.

417
00:31:18.280 --> 00:31:20.600
Okay. Everyone hold on target.

418
00:31:21.240 --> 00:31:24.360
Max. let us know when you're ready.
We start again on your go.

419
00:32:04.040 --> 00:32:05.320
Five is go for target.

420
00:32:05.400 --> 00:32:06.800
Start the sequence.

421
00:32:14.280 --> 00:32:16.160
-One. ready.
-Two. ready.

422
00:32:16.240 --> 00:32:18.560
-Three ready.
-Four ready.

423
00:32:18.640 --> 00:32:19.840
Five ready.

424
00:32:19.920 --> 00:32:21.840
Countdown. Three seconds.

425
00:32:22.480 --> 00:32:23.480
Three.

426
00:32:29.600 --> 00:32:31.560
Deploy!

427
00:32:31.640 --> 00:32:34.400
Show us your hands! Police!

428
00:32:34.480 --> 00:32:36.120
Don't move!

429
00:32:53.320 --> 00:32:54.720
Target one neutralized.

430
00:32:54.800 --> 00:32:56.480
Target 2 neutralized.

431
00:32:59.040 --> 00:33:01.040
Attention. priority alert. priority alert.

432
00:33:01.120 --> 00:33:05.120
Two officers down in hallway S.
Amal is wounded. I'm in pursuit.

433
00:33:05.200 --> 00:33:06.880
Five Tangos down. Confirmed.

434
00:33:06.960 --> 00:33:09.960
Tanya. stay with me.
Everyone else. evacuate the hostages.

435
00:33:10.040 --> 00:33:12.480
We've located
the rest of the CL-20.

436
00:33:14.120 --> 00:33:16.400
Evacuating the hostages.
do you copy?

437
00:33:16.480 --> 00:33:19.000
Evacuating the hostages.
Check their identity and then evacuate.

438
00:33:23.200 --> 00:33:24.960
Tanya. how's it looking?

439
00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:28.560
The last Oscar
is handcuffed to the device.

440
00:33:29.520 --> 00:33:31.440
All the charges are wired to a timer.

441
00:33:32.160 --> 00:33:34.000
It hasn't been activated.

442
00:33:35.080 --> 00:33:37.120
The handcuffs could be rigged.

443
00:33:39.640 --> 00:33:41.880
They're using a remote trigger.

444
00:33:48.440 --> 00:33:49.800
Oscar 9. confirmed.

445
00:33:50.760 --> 00:33:52.400
Oscar 4. Confirmed.

446
00:33:56.400 --> 00:33:59.840
David. it looks like Amal
has a remote trigger on her.

447
00:34:02.400 --> 00:34:04.080
Oscar 7. confirmed.

448
00:34:05.440 --> 00:34:06.680
Oscar 8. confirmed.

449
00:34:45.520 --> 00:34:47.120
Don't do it!

450
00:34:48.800 --> 00:34:50.960
Hey. Manon.

451
00:34:51.040 --> 00:34:54.160
It's Cédric. Everything's gonna be okay.

452
00:34:56.240 --> 00:34:58.160
Put the gun down.

453
00:34:59.760 --> 00:35:01.760
You haven't won. you know.

454
00:35:10.760 --> 00:35:12.120
Say goodbye…

455
00:35:12.960 --> 00:35:14.520
To your whole world.

456
00:35:16.360 --> 00:35:17.360
Now.

457
00:35:17.440 --> 00:35:18.800
No!

458
00:35:20.800 --> 00:35:23.176
The timer just started running.
We have five minutes.

459
00:35:23.200 --> 00:35:25.880
We have to evacuate
the whole building right now.

460
00:35:26.800 --> 00:35:29.120
All sections.
evacuate immediately.

461
00:35:29.200 --> 00:35:32.240
Get the hostages out first.
I repeat. hostages first.

462
00:35:32.320 --> 00:35:35.120
Copy that.
Evacuating hostages via building B.

463
00:35:35.200 --> 00:35:36.800
Eight Oscars identified. no injuries.

464
00:35:38.880 --> 00:35:40.280
We don't have Oscar 3.

465
00:35:40.360 --> 00:35:43.480
Let's get you out of here!
Follow the officers. hurry up! Come on.

466
00:35:45.920 --> 00:35:47.240
Who is Oscar 3?

467
00:35:50.760 --> 00:35:51.880
Who is Oscar 3?!

468
00:35:53.440 --> 00:35:54.960
Cédric. tell him.

469
00:35:56.320 --> 00:35:57.600
It's Manon.

470
00:36:00.680 --> 00:36:02.840
Hey. Manon. It'll be fine.

471
00:36:10.680 --> 00:36:13.040
You'll be all right. okay?
Just stay with me.

472
00:36:13.120 --> 00:36:15.600
Breathe. breathe. Slow breaths.

473
00:36:18.320 --> 00:36:20.280
There's something weird
about this setup.

474
00:36:20.360 --> 00:36:22.240
I'm gonna install a jammer
and secure Manon.

475
00:36:22.320 --> 00:36:23.320
Go for it.

476
00:36:25.240 --> 00:36:26.240
Hey. guys!

477
00:36:27.000 --> 00:36:29.520
Get out of here. please!
We have enough people. We'll handle it!

478
00:36:31.640 --> 00:36:32.840
We'll handle it!

479
00:36:42.160 --> 00:36:44.600
-Tanya. how much time?
-Four minutes.

480
00:36:44.680 --> 00:36:46.360
You just never listen. do you?

481
00:36:46.440 --> 00:36:48.560
Okay. focus. focus.
Eyes here. Breathe with me.

482
00:36:55.040 --> 00:36:57.800
Just got a hit.
Storage 237 belongs to Amal Mayard.

483
00:36:57.880 --> 00:36:59.520
Okay. we're almost there.

484
00:37:11.280 --> 00:37:12.720
Getting there now.

485
00:37:12.800 --> 00:37:14.560
I'm setting up the jammer.

486
00:37:17.840 --> 00:37:21.000
Manon. you gotta trust me.
It's gonna be fine. Just hang in there.

487
00:37:21.080 --> 00:37:24.280
Come on. It's okay.

488
00:37:24.360 --> 00:37:26.960
-They connected something to you?
-I don't know.

489
00:37:27.040 --> 00:37:29.080
Don't look at that. Look at me.

490
00:37:41.560 --> 00:37:42.840
Okay. it's fine.

491
00:37:46.520 --> 00:37:47.360
Daddy.

492
00:37:47.440 --> 00:37:48.640
You okay?

493
00:37:48.720 --> 00:37:49.920
Yeah?

494
00:37:50.000 --> 00:37:51.800
-How much time?
-2:30.

495
00:37:51.880 --> 00:37:53.040
Two minutes 30.

496
00:37:53.120 --> 00:37:55.360
-What happened to you?
-Oh. you like the look?

497
00:37:55.440 --> 00:37:57.440
Makes me look like a badass.
Should I keep it?

498
00:37:57.520 --> 00:37:59.600
At one minute. we have to get out.

499
00:38:00.440 --> 00:38:01.840
Get out. what does he mean?

500
00:38:01.920 --> 00:38:05.120
All of us. Get out of here together.
that's what he means. Right. Cédric?

501
00:38:05.200 --> 00:38:07.656
Besides. we're with the best here.
We have Tanya. You know her?

502
00:38:07.680 --> 00:38:10.160
She's so good. Okay?

503
00:38:10.240 --> 00:38:13.520
Y'know where she's from?
No? Nobody else does either.

504
00:38:13.600 --> 00:38:14.680
Cédric. where's Tanya from?

505
00:38:16.680 --> 00:38:18.600
Approaching the second floor.

506
00:38:19.560 --> 00:38:21.960
Heading towards unit 237.

507
00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:23.800
